{
  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-family: \u0026#39;Noto Serif SC\u0026#39;, serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #D4AF37, #FFC72C); box-sizing: border-box; color: #493b1b; display: block; padding: 25px 20px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 300; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e一整块温润的香槟暖金稳稳托住卷首导语，不张扬却自带杂志特辑的高光仪式感。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 8px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 20px 0; padding: 20px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #94751b; display: inline-block; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 15px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e暖金色块撑起专访气质\u003cspan style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #D4AF37, transparent); box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 2px; margin-top: 3px; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003csection\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 8px 0; text-align: justify\"\u003e香槟金开场卡与清爽白纸形成干脆利落的视觉分区，在模板市场一众黑白蓝绿中格外耀眼。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; border-left: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #666; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0\"\u003e真正珍贵的洞察，经得起金线般精准的提炼。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg\" alt=\"暖光书桌上的手账与咖啡\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 8px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 20px 0; padding: 25px 20px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #94751b; display: inline-block; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 25px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e香槟金笺的推荐用法\u003cspan style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #D4AF37, transparent); box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 2px; margin-top: 3px; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003csection\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: #333\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e人物专访、品牌创业史与年度回顾\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e品质生活方式与美学好物推荐\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e简洁利落，长短文章皆能稳稳驾驭\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin-bottom: 30px; padding-left: 15px\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border-left: 2px solid #D4AF37; box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 15px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: #f8f5f0; border-radius: 6px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 15px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 8px 0\"\u003e留住闪光的观点，让好内容历久弥新。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
